### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@apiKey = layla_warehouse_secret_key_change_me
@testPhone = 15551234567

### 1. Health Check (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Detailed Daemon & Queue Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/status
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### 3. Verify if a Phone Number is on WhatsApp
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/messages/verify-number/{{testPhone}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### 4. Send Simple Text Message (Enqueued asynchronously)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/messages/send-text
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "to": "{{testPhone}}",
  "message": "📦 Warehouse Notification: Order #4829 has been packed and is ready for pickup!",
  "waitForDelivery": false
}

### 5. Send Text Message (Wait for delivery confirmation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/messages/send-text
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "to": "{{testPhone}}",
  "message": "🚚 Dispatch Alert: Driver is on the way with your delivery.",
  "waitForDelivery": true
}

### 6. Send Document / PDF Invoice via URL
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/messages/send-media
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "to": "{{testPhone}}",
  "mediaType": "document",
  "url": "https://www.w3.org/WAI/ER/tests/xhtml/testfiles/resources/pdf/dummy.pdf",
  "fileName": "Invoice_4829.pdf",
  "caption": "Attached is your official packing slip and invoice.",
  "mimetype": "application/pdf",
  "waitForDelivery": false
}

### 7. Send Image via URL
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/messages/send-media
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "to": "{{testPhone}}",
  "mediaType": "image",
  "url": "https://picsum.photos/600/400",
  "caption": "Warehouse parcel photo for verification.",
  "waitForDelivery": false
}

### 8. Inspect Outbound Message Queue
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### 9. Request 8-Digit Pairing Code (Alternative to QR Code)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/pairing-code
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "phone": "{{testPhone}}"
}

### 10. Logout & Reset WhatsApp Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
